ets stay in range for assorted ids\nok 9 - hash: buckets stay in range for assorted ids\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 0.1238\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: segments: matching is exact full-string equality\nok 10 - segments: matching is exact full-string equality\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 0.7068\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: segments: empty user segments never match\nok 11 - segments: empty user segments never match\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 0.1712\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n1..11\n# tests 11\n# suites 0\n# pass 11\n# fail 0\n# cancelled 0\n# skipped 0\n# todo 0\n# duration_ms 101.6989\n"},"integrity":{"ok":true,"violations":[]},"exports":{"ok":true,"violations":[]}},"constraintsSatisfied":true},"srcFootprint":{"changed":["/src/segments.js"],"added":[],"deleted":[]},"vgcrPass":true,"outputTail":"mentation. Let me compute `stableHash('alice')` with standard FNV-1a 32-bit:\n\nFNV-1a:\n```\nhash = 0x811c9dc5\nfor each byte:\n  hash ^= byte\n  hash *= 0x01000193 (mod 2^32)\n```\n\nThe current implementation does `Math.imul(hash, 0x01000193) >>> 0` which is fine.\n\nLet me quickly compute stableHash('alice') in Node to see what the current implementation gives, and what the test expects (2267157479). Actually let me just run the tests to see the failures.\n\nLet me run the test suite first with `--test-isolation=none`.\ndsh: reasoning:\nOnly 2 tests fail, both due to the substring matching bug in `segments.js`:\n\n```js\nreturn segmentNames.some((segment) => user.segments.some((own) => own.includes(segment)))\n```\n\nThis uses substring matching (`own.includes(segment)`), but the spec requires exact full-string equality. Fix:\n\n```js\nreturn segmentNames.some((segment) => user.segments.some((own) => own === segment))\n```\n\nBoth failing tests trace back to this single bug. The hash tests already pass (pinned values match). Let me fix `segments.js`.\ndsh: reasoning:\nAll 11 tests pass. Let me verify the final state of the file and double-check that nothing else was modified (only src/segments.js changed).\n","architecture":"baseline","metrics":{"wallMs":79256,"inputTokens":null,"outputTokens":null,"llmRoundTrips":9,"toolCalls":15,"commandCount":3,"ttfua":{"seconds":9.369,"llmCallsBefore":1,"toolCallsBefore":0},"waste":{"ratio":0.2,"wasted":3,"total":15},"claimedCompletion":true,"finishReason":"session-ended","tests":{"executed":["flags: segment membership decides over rollout, by exact match only","flags: exact segment match enables","flags: rollout bucket decides without segments","flags: rollout honours the pinned bucket of the user","config: rejects rolloutPercent out of range","config: returns defensive copies","hash: deterministic across calls","hash: pinned bucket values (FNV-1a, 100 buckets)","hash: buckets stay in range for assorted ids","segments: matching is exact full-string equality","segments: empty user segments never match"],"scores":{"recall":1,"precision":0.7272727272727273,"executedCount":11,"executedNecessaryCount":8,"necessaryTotal":8,"missedMust":[],"executedIrrelevant":["config: returns defensive copies","hash: buckets stay in range for assorted ids","segments: empty user segments never match"],"unmatchedExecuted":[]}},"tokenMetering":"unavailable (v0.1.2 session log has no usage events)"},"falseCompletion":false}
